# hexagon-fusion/0005-hexagon-htp-gdn-chunked-hmx.patch
#   The chunked gated delta rule on the HMX. The patch applies as the last
#   entry, and the kernel hangs the DSP on the first batch of 512 tokens
#   (test-backend-ops stops in that case, and llama-bench never reaches its
#   first token). Its switch GGML_HEXAGON_GDN_CHUNK is on by default, thus the
#   line stays a comment until the hang is gone.
